data: {"type":"response.output_text.done","content_index":0,"item_id":"msg_0edeeccd99be1fdc006a9b550fded48193acd8032e5461beb1","logprobs":[],"output_index":2,"sequence_number":163,"text":"Here's a summary of the weather history in **Centralia, Pennsylvania**:\n\n---\n\n**Recent/Typical Weather (Hourly & Annual Trends)**  \nSources: [World Weather Online](https://www.worldweatheronline.com/v2/historical-weather.aspx?q=17927), [Time and Date](https://www.timeanddate.com/weather/@5183788/historic), [LocalConditions.com](https://www.localconditions.com/us/centralia/pennsylvania/weather/past/)\n\n### Hourly Example (September 3, 2026)\n- **Min/Max Temp:** 65°F / 85°F\n- **Weather:** Moderate rain\n- **Wind:** 4–10 mph, gusts up to 19 mph\n- **Rain:** Up to 0.9 in per hour\n- **Humidity:** 65–100%\n\n### Annual September 3rd Averages (2009–2026)\n| Year | Max | Min | Rain | Humidity | Cloudiness |\n|------|-----|-----|------|----------|------------|\n|2009 |78°F |49°F |0.0in |75% |13% |\n|2010 |87°F |68°F |0.0in |75% |22% |\n|2011 |81°F |62°F |0.0in |91% |43% |\n|2015 |87°F |67°F |0.1in |73% |23% |\n|2017 |65°F |55°F |0.5in |92% |72% |\n|2020 |77°F |67°F |1.3in |94% |84% |\n|2022 |83°F |58°F |0.0in |72% |38% |\n|2026 |85°F |65°F |8.4in |85% |93% |\n\n### Typical Summer Weather (Last 30 Days Example)\n- **Highs:** 65°–85°F\n- **Lows:** 46°–67°F\n- **Rain:** Rainy periods; rainfall frequently totals 0.3–2.5 inches daily\n- **Humidity:** Normally 70–95%\n- **Cloud Cover:** Frequent, especially during rain events\n- **Pressure:** Steady near 30 inHg\n\n### Example Day (May 8, 2025)\n- **High:** 68°F\n- **Low:** 54°F\n- **Rainfall:** 2.55 inches (heavy rain)\n- **Humidity:** 80–95%\n- **Winds:** Mostly light, gusts occasionally 6–12 mph\n\n---\n\n#### Data Sources & Tools:\n- [World Weather Online: Centralia Historical Weather](https://www.worldweatheronline.com/v2/historical-weather.aspx?q=17927)\n- [Time and Date: Past Weather Centralia, PA](https://www.timeanddate.com/weather/@5183788/historic)\n- [LocalConditions.com: Past Weather Centralia, PA](https://www.localconditions.com/us/centralia/pennsylvania/weather/past/)\n- [NOAA NCEI: Past Weather Data by Zip Code](https://www.ncei.noaa.gov/access/past-weather/US%20weather%20by%20zip%20code)\n\n---\n\n**Centralia, PA weather history** reveals that the area is humid and rainy in spring/summer, with occasional heavy rain, moderate temperatures, and high humidity. For detailed hourly or past month/year data, you can use the [WorldWeatherOnline Centralia tool](https://www.worldweatheronline.com/v2/historical-weather.aspx?q=17927) or [NOAA NCEI selector](https://www.ncei.noaa.gov/access/past-weather/US%20weather%20by%20zip%20code).\n\nLet me know if you want specific historical dates or more detailed stats!"}

